      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but even talking to someone feels like just another thing on the to-do list. another person i have to explain myself to, another person who'll just give me the same \"it gets better\" speech. it doesn't feel like it's getting better though. it just feels like the walls are closing in. like there's no actual way out of this hole, no matter how much i struggle. everything is just... stuck.",
