    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a single act of surrender\"... that's a weird thing to say. but i get what you mean. the fighting is what's killing me. i'm just so tired of pretending i can handle it. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to not have to be \"me\" anymore. is that even possible? to just... stop?",
